    "result_text": "Typecheck is clean and both acceptance tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented a full-stack, additive change: **opening a project now shows its invoices, their total, and a form to add a new invoice.**\n\n**Database** (`src/main/resources/db/migration/V4__invoices.sql`)\n- New `invoice` table (`id`, `project_id` FK \u2192 `project`, `amount NUMERIC(12,2)`), following the existing IDENTITY convention.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST + Spring beans, one file per endpoint)\n- `Invoice` entity + `InvoiceRepository`.\n- `GET /api/invoices` (`InvoicesGet` + `invoices.GET.yml`) \u2014 lists all invoices, each carrying its `projectId`.\n- `POST /api/invoices` (`InvoicesPost` + `NewInvoice` + `invoices.POST.yml`) \u2014 validates the project exists and amount is positive, saves, and records an `INVOICE_CREATED \u2026` audit line via the `Audit` service.\n- Extended `TestSupportController` (app code, not pinned) to seed `invoices` and to `TRUNCATE \u2026 RESTART IDENTITY` the new table on reset, seeding with the fixture's explicit ids via `JdbcTemplate`.\n\n**Front-end** (all new files, plus one structural slot install)\n- `routes/projects.tsx` \u2014 one-line `<Outlet />` layout for the section.\n- `routes/projects.$projectId.tsx` \u2014 the detail route (drill-in is a child route, not a flag); renders the `project.detail` slot.\n- `slots/defs/projectDetail.ts` and `slots/defs/projectRowActions.ts` \u2014 two new slot regions.\n- `features/invoices/InvoicesPanel.tsx` + `invoices.slot.tsx` \u2014 queries `['invoices']` for itself, filters to this project, renders `project-invoices-table`, `invoice-row-<id>`/`invoice-amount` (2-decimal), the derived `project-invoices-total`, and the add-invoice form; writes via `useMutation` + `invalidateQueries(['invoices'])`.\n- `features/projects/open.slot.tsx` \u2014 the `project-open-<id>` link, filling the row-actions slot.\n- `ProjectsPage.tsx` \u2014 minimal edit to *install* the `ProjectRowActions.Slot` extension point in each row (the sanctioned \"region doesn't exist yet, add it\" case), not hardcoded feature content.\n\nVerified with `bin/e2e` (both `@core` specs pass) and `npm run typecheck` (clean).\n\nOne design note worth flagging: the invoices list fetches all invoices under the shared `['invoices']` key and filters by project client-side, rather than a project-scoped endpoint \u2014 chosen to stay strictly within the demonstrated dependency-injection pattern (no query/path-param binding), and it keeps the shared-key invalidation trivial. Easy to swap to a scoped endpoint later if desired.",
